---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Base title="About Us" description="the site is an independent sports analytics platform. Data-driven predictions, public track record, no cherry-picking.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">About {SITE.name}</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg">
      {SITE.name} is an independent sports analytics platform. We publish football predictions, review licensed bookmakers, and keep a public track record of every pick we release.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Our promise</h2>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
      <li>Every published pick is tracked publicly — wins and losses, no cherry-picking.</li>
      <li>We only feature licensed, regulated bookmakers.</li>
      <li>We put responsible gambling first, always.</li>
      <li>Every rule change is a public commit — nothing is silently retro-fitted.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">How the pipeline works</h2>
    <p>
      In short: our proprietary consensus engine cross-checks multiple independent signals, publishes picks in three separate tracked systems (WIN, OVERALL, ROI) by odds band, and settles every match from independent score resolvers with a public conflict log. The full auditable methodology — without the internal formulas — is on our <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/methodology">Methodology page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Why we're independent</h2>
    <p>
      We do not accept bets. Our revenue comes from optional paid tip subscriptions and affiliate commissions when a visitor clicks through to a licensed bookmaker — that never costs you anything and never influences a pick. Every review is written independently. Every operator we recommend is licensed by a European regulator.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Where we're based</h2>
    <p>
      {SITE.name} operates from Cyprus. All data processing follows EU GDPR. Legal disputes fall under Cyprus law — see the <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/terms">Terms of Use</a> and <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Track record</h2>
    <p>
      Since the GENESIS date, our clean-slate tracked systems maintain distinct edges in each odds band. Live figures and the full settled record are on <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/results">/results</a>. Past performance is not a guarantee of future results.
    </p>

    <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-white mt-10 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Feedback, corrections, partnerships, privacy requests — write to <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or use the <a class="text-brand-400 underline" href="/contact">Contact page</a>. We answer every email within 48 hours.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-10 text-xs text-slate-500">
      {SITE.name} — sports analytics for the {SITE.minAge}+ audience only. Please gamble responsibly.
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
